msgstr "28 फ़रवरी की तारीख वाली एंट्री 1:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:161
msgid ""
"Line 2: Income account 200 + 100 = **300** (recognizing 2/12 of invoice A "
