#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/mexico.rst:14
msgid ""
"Mexico has one of the most advanced e-invoicing systems globally, with "
"electronic invoicing :abbr:`CFDI (Comprobante Fiscal Digital por Internet)` "
"being mandatory for most taxpayers. Key elements include:"
msgstr ""
