#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the ZATCA-compliant XML invoice formats "
"required for tax invoices, simplified tax invoices, credit notes, and debit "
"notes. Odoo also supports QR code generation and mandatory invoice fields "
"required under the Fatoora framework for compliant B2B and B2C invoicing "
"transactions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:38
msgid ""
"**ZATCA integration**: Odoo integrates with ZATCA APIs to automate invoice "
"clearance, reporting, validation, and synchronization directly from the ERP "
"system. Odoo supports both Phase 1 and Phase 2 e-invoicing requirements, "
"including onboarding and communication with ZATCA’s integration platform."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: Odoo securely stores electronic invoices, "
"XML files, QR codes, and ZATCA responses within the system, allowing "
"businesses to retrieve compliant records for audits, legal retention "
"requirements, and operational purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing helps businesses "
