"format required by the Turkish Revenue Administration (GİB) for e-Fatura and "
"e-Arşiv invoices. This ensures invoices comply with Turkish e-invoicing "
"regulations for both B2B and B2C transactions. Odoo also supports "
"integration with certified GİB private integrator for compliant invoice "
"transmission."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: Odoo sends electronic invoice XML files to "
"Nilvera, a certified private integrator, which securely stores the data on "
"servers located in Türkiye in accordance with Turkish e-invoicing and data "
"retention requirements. This ensures invoices remain accessible for "
"retrieval, audits, and legal compliance purposes."
