"determine the applicable tax treatment and procedures for specific items. "
"The product's applicability to this requirement can be verified at https://"
"www.codigocest.com.br/."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CEST कोड`: टैक्स वर्गीकरण कोड जो ICMS नियमों के तहत टैक्स प्रतिस्थापन के "
