msgstr "ECPay वेंडर पोर्टल पर कॉन्फ़िगरेशन"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/ecpay.rst:13
msgid ""
"`Create an account <https://vendor.ecpay.com.tw/User/LogOn_Step1>`_ on the "
